// ▀▄▀▄▀ █ █░▀█ █▄▀ █▄█ ▀▄▀▄▀   █▀▄ █▄█ █▄▄ ██▄ ▄█
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Window / layer rules
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

window-rule {
    // Slight rounded corners.
    geometry-corner-radius 0
    clip-to-geometry true
}

// Assorted window rules.
window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^Pinentry-gtk$"#
    match app-id=r#"^Tk$"#
    match app-id=r#"^gimp$"# title=r#"Preferences"#
    match app-id=r#"^mpv$"#
    match app-id=r#"^soffice$"# title=r#"^Text Import"#
    match app-id=r#"^virt-manager$"# title=r#" - Connection Details"#
    match app-id=r#"^wev$"#
    match app-id=r#"^xarchiver$"#
    // match app-id=r#"firefox$"# title=r#"^(Picture-in-Picture|Library|About Mozilla Firefox|Firefox - Choose a profile)$"#

    open-floating true
}


window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^com\.gabm\.satty$"#
    open-floating true
    min-width 730
    min-height 300
}

// Default size For Software Window
window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^kitty$"#
    match app-id=r#"^firefox$"#
    match app-id="org.gnome.Nautilus"
    background-effect {
        blur true
    }
    default-column-width {
        proportion 1.0
    }
}
window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^KeePassXC$"#
    block-out-from "screencast"
}

window-rule {
    match app-id="org.gnome.Nautilus"
    match app-id="mpv"
    opacity 0.83
    background-effect {
        blur true
        noise 0.02
        saturation 1.1
    }
}

window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^thunar$"# title=r#"^Rename "#
    open-floating true

    default-column-width { proportion 0.65; }
    default-window-height { proportion 0.7; }

    opacity 0.83
    background-effect {
        blur true
        noise 0.02
        saturation 1.1
    }
}

window-rule {
    match app-id=r#"^blueman-manager$"#
    match app-id=r#"^org.pulseaudio.pavucontrol$"#

    open-floating true
    default-column-width { proportion 0.65; }
    default-window-height { proportion 0.7; }

    opacity 0.83
    background-effect {
        blur true
        noise 0.02
        saturation 1.1
    }
}

layer-rule {
    match namespace="^wallpaper$"
    place-within-backdrop false
}
